OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Reform UK flag
OL,4,Apolicy to be reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial policy around which
OL,7,Fflags are flown above town halls in
OL,8,FKirklees will be reconsidered by the
OL,9,Fcouncil leader.
OL,11,FIt comes after the Reform UK-led
OL,12,Fcouncil approved a move meaning only
OL,13,Fthe Union flag, Flag of St George and
OL,14,FCivic Flag could be flown from town
OL,15,Fhalls. LGTBQ+ pride flags and Windrush
OL,16,Fflags, which have previously been
OL,17,Fflown, are now not allowed.
OL,19,FCouncil leader Sarah Wood was called
OL,20,Fbefore a scrutiny committee, with
OL,21,Fcouncillors arguing there had been a
OL,22,F"complete failure" in openness.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
