OL,4,Apolicy to be reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee recommended a
OL,7,Fconsultation before any decision was
OL,8,Ftaken on the flying of alternative
OL,9,Fflags and clarification on the policy
OL,10,Fonly referring to the area's four town
OL,11,Fhalls.
